Z||000011||p4n1c||06-25-2001||12:27 AM||||Thanks a lot for the good day of sunning and riding the sea-doo.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Bad thing happened on the way home.  Engine died on the 401 just outside Kitchener.  Everything else stayed on, just the engine quit, she would crank but wouldn't start.  My ex-girlfriend came and picked me up and her parents had my car towed on their CAA to their place where the car now sits, I thank her a lot for that.<P>I made it home though, thankfully.<P>Again thanks a lot for the beach day.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>1988 Olds Cutlass Supreme International<BR>2.8L MPFI V6/TH440-T4<BR>*Under Restoration*||||reg||1
